Final_06: 50 bonus points
Please state the status of this question:
1. Incomplete
2. Solved with testing?
3. Solved without testing?
If solved, please BRIEFLY explain your strategy.

I solved with testing.
I generalized the non recursive no loop idea from Quiz01_03. Instead of manually writing a fixed number of
bubble sort passes I defined non recursive helper functions that repeat a unit of work 1, 2, 4, 8, ... times. Using
these helpers I implemented insertion sort by repeatedly inserting A[i] into the sorted prefix A[0...i-1] without the 
loops or recursion. I tested the solution on integer and string arrays.

